sult >= s for s in scores)\n    \"\"\"\n    result = best_score(scores)\n    _assert_postconditions(scores, result)\n\n\ndef test_best_score_single_element_returns_that_element():\n    \"\"\"单元素列表应返回该唯一元素。\n\n    期望值来源：规约边界情况 + 后置条件（返回值必须是元素）。\n    \"\"\"\n    scores = [42]\n    result = best_score(scores)\n    assert result == 42\n    _assert_postconditions(scores, result)\n\n\ndef test_best_score_all_equal_returns_common_value():\n    \"\"\"全部元素相等时应返回该公共值。\n\n    期望值来源：规约边界情况 + 后置条件。\n    \"\"\"\n    scores = [7, 7, 7, 7]\n    result = best_score(scores)\n    assert result == 7\n    _assert_postconditions(scores, result)\n\n\ndef test_best_score_with_negative_numbers():\n    \"\"\"含负数列表应返回其中最大的（最接近零的）负数。\n\n    期望值来源：规约边界情况 + 后置条件。\n    \"\"\"\n    scores = [-10, -3, -7, -1, -5]\n    result = best_score(scores)\n    assert result == -1\n    _assert_postconditions(scores, result)\n\n\ndef test_best_score_with_zero():\n    \"\"\"含 0 的列表应正确比较 0 与其他元素。\n\n    期望值来源：规约边界情况 + 后置条件。\n    \"\"\"\n    scores = [-1, 0, -2]\n    result = best_score(scores)\n    assert result == 0\n    _assert_postconditions(scores, result)\n\n\ndef test_best_score_large_integers():\n    \"\"\"大整数应能正确比较。\n\n    期望值来源：规约边界情况 + 后置条件。\n    \"\"\"\n    scores = [10 ** 30, 10 ** 31, 10 ** 29]\n    result = best_score(scores)\n    assert result == 10 ** 31\n    _assert_postconditions(scores, result)\n\n\n# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------\n# 前置条件违反：空列表\n# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\ndef test_best_score_empty_list_raises():\n    \"\"\"空列表违反前置条件 len(scores) > 0。\n\n    期望值来源：规约前置条件。规约未定义空列表的返回行为，\n    因此仅断言其不满足前置条件时抛出异常（IndexError 或 ValueError），\n    不臆造具体异常类型以外的返回值。\n    \"\"\"\n    with pytest.raises((IndexError, ValueError)):\n        best_score([])",
